WEBVTT

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:10.900
I hate the occult!

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:14.860
A cell phone?

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:25.000
That was bright.

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:22.700
Wait!

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:24.410
Please wait!

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:28.330
<i>No!</i>

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.170
Wai-

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:38.880
"Wai"?

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:51.970
The word is actually an anagram,
referring to Napoleon.

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:51.980
What a day...

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:54.310
It's all lies!

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:57.740
More like "Nostra-lies-mus," if you ask me!

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:02.910
Supernatural powers like
prognostication exist.

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:13.450
<b>Special: The
Nostradamus Prophecies</b>

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:13.450
<b>A boy with supernatural
powers, here in the studio!</b>

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:07.030
We've invited a guest to the studio today.

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:09.370
Let's have him come in.

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:14.110
The famous spoon-bending
boy, Uchida Fumiaki-kun!

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:25.390
Welcome.

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:28.860
Bunmei-kun, how are you doing?

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:31.830
It's not "Bunmei." It's Fumiaki.

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:33.840
I'm doing...

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.010
...okay, I guess.

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:39.530
Bunmei-kun! Bunmei-kun!

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.530
Let's watch

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:42.580
Uchida Fumiaki-kun's spoon-bending trick!

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:57.290
It's bending!

00:03:56.890 --> 00:03:58.200
Enough!

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:58.200
That hard spoon is bending!

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:02.290
Everyone's obsessed with the occult...

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:07.340
Camera mode?

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:29.030
Is something wrong?

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:31.790
With Principal Kumashiro Jun'ichiro gone,

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:35.370
I think it's only natural that I,
his only living relative,

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.210
assume his post.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:39.290
Is there a problem?

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:41.710
No, but, um...

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:44.930
A will?

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:51.640
I, Kumashiro Jun'ichiro, bequeath my entire fortune,
including Waldstein Academy, to my former wife Kanae.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:59.940
If Kanae cannot inherit this fortune,
I leave it to my daughter Maya.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.360
It was written three years ago.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:05.120
It was kept in a safe deposit box at the bank.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:06.150
By the way,

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:10.290
security at this school is awful.

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:12.660
A pervert appeared yesterday.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.330
A pervert?

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.300
I-I'm terribly sorry!

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:17.650
I shall have security strengthened
immediately-

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:20.290
No, it's fine as is.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:25.000
<i>Having a bunch of problems will
make it easier to get rid of this place.</i>

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:30.200
Bring me all the accounts and a list of your
finances for each of the past several years.

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:35.510
Before that, a new teacher has arrived,
whom I'd like to introduce.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.270
Come in.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.980
Excuse me.

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:51.540
He'll be teaching sophomore history.

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:53.430
His name is Abe Minoru.

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:56.870
Would you leave us for a moment?

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:01.120
O-Of course!

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:09.010
My name is Abe. I-

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:10.920
I hate the occult.

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:11.720
What are you...

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:14.060
Don't play dumb with me!

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.770
You suddenly appear from the sky.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.600
You disappear like the wind.

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:23.700
And then, when I take a picture
of myself with your phone,

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:25.010
I see a skull!

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.690
You used it?

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:29.700
Who are you?!

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:33.700
Please return my phone.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.220
I...

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:36.350
You?

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:37.370
The future...

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:38.370
The future?

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.790
I can't save the future!

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:51.310
I... I'm a time agent.

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:52.630
A time agent?

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:57.970
I've come here, to the past,
to protect the future.

00:06:57.970 --> 00:07:00.810
In 2012, the Earth...

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:04.900
The Earth is ruled by aliens!

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:13.780
They appeared from another dimension and took
over almost the entire world in an instant.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:18.710
The survivors formed a resistance
and waged a guerilla war.

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:23.000
Then we acquired a piece
of alien technology!

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:28.860
How many Abe Minorus do we have left?

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:30.220
One.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.140
Let me confirm this.

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:40.520
What's your ability, #6?

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.380
Psychokinesis.

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:44.080
Your grades at the camp?

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.510
Top of my class.

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:46.770
What's your mission?

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:49.530
To prevent the Nostradamus Prophecies.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:51.270
Nostradamus...

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:58.910
If only we had understood how accurate
he was, we might have avoided this.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:02.380
In the seventh month of the year 1999,

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.660
a Great King of Terror will
come from the sky.

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:07.430
He will revive the mighty
king of Angolmois.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.220
His prophecy came true

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:12.990
July 21st, 1999.

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:16.900
Here, in Nagano Prefecture, Matsushiro,
at Waldstein Academy,

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:20.470
a rift to another dimension opened,
and they appeared.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:26.650
Several minutes later, the school and everything
within a fifty-kilometer radius was a blasted wasteland.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:30.230
By the way, do you know why this happened?

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:34.910
Even then, Waldstein Academy was a crazy
enough place to be called "Occult Academy."

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:39.910
Some item there must have triggered
the creation of this dimensional rift.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:45.030
We call this item "Nostradamus's Key."

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.540
If we can find and destroy it,

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:50.150
we can change the future
and rescue humanity.

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:54.880
But it seems that we underestimated
Occult Academy.

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:56.340
A monster!

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:58.210
I'm being chased by a monster,
a monster I've never seen before.

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:00.510
I can't handle it with pyrokinesis.

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:02.220
Forget about the key!

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:03.840
Hurry!

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:10.400
I'm not a screw-up like #5.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:16.990
This is the information gathered
by Abe Minoru #1-#5.

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:22.000
And the complete philosophical
works of Gustav Waldstein.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.700
Get all of it into your head.

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:26.070
It'll take one night with the headset.

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:28.000
There's something else.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:31.820
This is a 1999 high school
Japanese history textbook.

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:34.300
Abe Minoru is a Japanese history teacher.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.630
Study it.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:39.820
This one's analog, huh?

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:45.060
Meddling with the past is a delicate matter.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:48.560
Depending on your actions, you could
erase us from existence altogether.

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:52.100
This may appear to be just a '99 cell phone,

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:56.820
but it's an historical change simulator,
built using "their" technology.

00:09:56.820 --> 00:10:00.360
If you photograph that, while thinking
of what you intend to do with it,

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:03.900
you can see what the results will be in 2012.

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:09.750
If you don't intend to do anything with it,
it will simply show the subject, as it exists in 2012.

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.030
In other words?

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:14.880
If you see something suspicious,
think of destroying it and photograph it.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:18.240
If you see a peaceful 2012, with no aliens,

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:21.120
it's Nostradamus's Key.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:23.850
Put another way, this cell phone
will let you find the key.

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:27.390
It contains a normal 3D camera, as well.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:29.480
Send us data of important people with it.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.920
Report in often.

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:37.240
Communications are essentially one-way, 
from the past to the present.

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:40.080
In the one-in-a-thousand chance of
some danger, we'll respond.

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:43.160
That's the only time you'll be able
to communicate with us.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.090
Five-in-a-thousand, you mean.

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:47.060
Five people are dead already.

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:51.270
Commander, we're ready.

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:56.190
Watch out for space-time storms.

00:10:56.190 --> 00:11:00.340
They'll strip you naked and might
knock you off-course.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:05.680
The fate of humanity rests
on your shoulders!

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:08.030
We're counting on you, #6!

00:11:08.030 --> 00:11:10.470
We're counting on you, Uchida Fumiaki!

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:15.110
Thus, I...

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:17.840
I said I hate the occult.

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:19.500
Aliens! Psychic powers!

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:20.830
Shut up already!

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:24.740
You made that "space-time
storm" thing up just now!

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:29.070
And that Uchida whosits kid was on
TV yesterday, bending spoons!

00:11:29.070 --> 00:11:29.920
That's me!

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:32.330
That's me ten years ago-

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:34.130
Then bend this.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:56.520
You're taking too long!

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:58.540
Get out!

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:03.740
What the hell was that?

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:06.060
The Nostradamus Prophecies?

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:14.070
July, 1999. A Great King of Terror
will come from the sky...

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:17.290
From the sky...

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:22.970
No way! It's him?

00:12:31.470 --> 00:12:33.590
Did you see that Nostradamus
thing yesterday?

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:36.410
The pro side sucked, as always.

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:39.430
Seriously, humanity destroyed? No way!

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:43.640
Nostradamus's Final Prophecy: 1999.

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:40.960
You guys sure are taking it easy.

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:43.650
My house already installed a fallout shelter.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:46.530
I think she's an expert!

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.820
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:12:48.820 --> 00:12:50.340
Maya-san!

00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:54.420
She knew all about the occult,
and she fought so valiantly!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:57.560
She must really love it.

00:12:57.560 --> 00:13:00.240
But then she acts like she doesn't...

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:02.320
I don't get it!

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:07.430
I don't think Maya honestly hates it.

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:08.770
Then...

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:13.840
She transferred schools because
of her parents' divorce.

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:15.390
It's an adult problem.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:17.730
But...

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:25.950
Maybe what really wasn't going well was...

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.500
This is #6.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:32.340
Commencing my investigation.

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:37.210
<b>Biology Storage Room</b>

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:40.790
<b>History Storage Room</b>

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:44.510
<b>Parapsychology Storage Room</b>

00:13:57.680 --> 00:14:00.350
This place is insane!

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:02.020
It's like some crazy museum of weird stuff.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:05.240
Any of these things could
be Nostradamus's Key.

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:08.460
I don't know if I can find it by the 21st...

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:09.490
What are you doing here?

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.200
I-I'm sorry.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:15.610
I thought I'd walk around the school
to get ready for tomorrow.

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.630
Fine. I'll be right there.

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:30.390
We will now cremate the body.

00:14:41.550 --> 00:14:44.480
I can arrange other living quarters for you.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.190
No.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:50.260
I want to see how my father lived.

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:52.320
In that case, goodnight.

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:57.660
The principal was cremated,
and the evidence is gone.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:00.670
We're safe now, I guess.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:04.550
Fool. The daughter is trying to
become the next principal.

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:05.940
This is bad.

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:08.010
She might see through us.

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.760
Then before that can happen...

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:39.950
Who's there?

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:08.180
<b>don't get in
the way</b>

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:32.160
Not this, either.

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:34.870
How many photos have I taken?

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:37.150
This mission is some boring stuff.

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:51.990
Hey. Are you okay-

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:54.570
So it's your doing, Great King?!

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:56.340
Great King? What?!

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:57.340
Don't try and fool me!

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:59.570
In the seventh month of the year 1999!

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:01.830
A Great King of Terror will
come from the sky!

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:03.950
And you're the Great King!

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:05.830
What are you talking about?

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:08.130
The day in the prophecy is July 21st!

00:17:08.780 --> 00:17:10.400
I'm not the Great King!

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:11.630
What's that, then?

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:17.350
Get away from me!

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:33.710
Hey! Get up, Great King!

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:34.610
You want to die?

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:36.610
Pervert!

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:37.390
Time agent!

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:38.320
#6!

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:41.130
Spoon-bender!

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:42.170
Anything!

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:43.450
Get up!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.500
Looks like an old notebook.

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:30.340
My father's notebook.

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:33.290
He used to record his
research results in it.

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:38.030
Of course, none of it was any good.

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:39.830
Thanks to that, we...

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:41.140
"We"?

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:42.260
Nothing.

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:46.200
Is it Kanae reading this?

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:48.230
Or Maya?

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:52.940
Either way, take this notebook
and run from here now.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.900
And never come back.

00:18:57.520 --> 00:19:03.950
These last few years, as an Occult Researcher,
I have investigated the Nostradamus Prophecies.

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:09.790
And I've found that by discovering and destroying
the key to the prophecies, I can stop them.

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:16.810
But now, there are those who do not agree
with my research, and they're out for my head.

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:23.820
If one of you is reading this,
it means their plan has succeeded.

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:25.240
<i>He was killed?</i>

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:27.850
<i>He had Nostradamus's Key?</i>

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:30.190
<i>What this guy said was true?</i>

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:38.320
This book contains defensive spells to protect
you from attacks by all of my enemies.

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:41.660
It will keep you safe.

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:47.450
Go, forget everything, and live in peace.

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:51.860
What are you doing?

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:57.630
No... I was thinking that maybe the
book itself was the key, but it's not.

00:19:57.630 --> 00:20:01.090
If it were the key,
you'd see a peaceful future-

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:02.900
Of course!

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:05.430
My father was researching how
to prevent the prophecy!

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:06.630
What?

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:08.180
You were the one who said
none of it was any good-

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:10.520
It upsets me when other people say it!

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:27.310
<i>Go, forget everything,
and live in peace.</i>

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:37.460
I'm your new teacher, Abe Minoru.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:39.680
I teach Japanese history.

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:42.600
I teach Japanese history.

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:42.600
Abe Minoru

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:42.590
It's a normal field of study,
with no relationship to the occult,

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.720
but take it seriously.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:47.060
So let's get started.

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:55.740
You're not the principal?

00:20:55.740 --> 00:20:57.720
What are you doing in my class?

00:20:57.720 --> 00:21:01.570
When I learned my father had died,
do you know what I thought?

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:03.580
"That's what you get."

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:06.910
And I took over as principal
to destroy the school.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:09.620
But I changed my mind.

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:14.500
If someone killed my father,
then I'm going to find out who!

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:16.460
Find out...

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.450
I'm going to find the key.

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:19.670
With you.

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:21.420
Nostradamus's Key.

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:27.760
If they know that, despite killing the principal,
his daughter's taking over for him,

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:30.390
they'll come after me again.

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:35.200
I haven't started believing you,
and I haven't forgiven you.

00:21:35.200 --> 00:21:40.050
But if I work with you, we can exchange information,
and it'll make things easier for me.

00:21:40.050 --> 00:21:41.150
Don't you think?

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:44.280
Of course, your life will also be at risk.

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:46.530
But you're fine with that, right?

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.180
You want to team up?

00:21:51.150 --> 00:21:52.500
With me?

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:56.340
Can I ask you something?

00:21:57.360 --> 00:21:59.960
You do like the occult, don't you?

00:22:05.610 --> 00:22:08.250
I said I hate it!

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:51.820
I'm Uchida Fumiaki, a time agent
from the year 2012.

00:23:51.820 --> 00:23:54.370
With my psychokinesis, which I used
to astound the world with my spoon-bending,

00:23:54.370 --> 00:23:57.400
I will find Nostradamus's Key
and stop the prophecy!

00:23:57.400 --> 00:24:00.590
Even if it's to find the person
who killed my father,

00:24:00.590 --> 00:24:03.150
I can't believe I'm teaming up with a guy
who's the walking personification of the occult.

00:24:03.150 --> 00:24:04.700
You really love it.

00:24:04.700 --> 00:24:05.510
You're such a tsun-

00:24:05.510 --> 00:24:08.740
That word didn't exist in 1999!

00:24:08.740 --> 00:24:10.400
Next time on <i>Occult Academy</i>, Episode 3:

00:24:10.400 --> 00:24:12.360
MIKAZE blows through.

00:24:12.360 --> 00:24:14.990
The occult is so stupid!

00:24:15.030 --> 00:24:19.670
This program is a work of fiction.
Departed spirits, psychic abilities,
aliens, UMAs, etc., do not exist.

00:24:16.320 --> 00:24:21.670
Unless you believe in them...
